{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06686","headline":"秦中守岁 · 储光羲","name":"秦中守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆星已穷次，青帝方行春。\n永感易成戚，离居难重陈。\n阖门守初夜，燎火到清晨。\n或念无生法，多伤未出尘。\n广庭日将晏，虚室自爲宾。\n愿以桑榆末，常逢甲子新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}